   "new_text": "local function page_frame(screen, seconds)\n    -- Port 26088801: the page's natives are verified before the page is touched; while one is not\n    -- resident yet the page stays as the game drew it (gameplay input is unaffected).\n    local waiting = page_code_waiting()\n    if waiting then\n        if state.page_deferred ~= waiting then\n            state.page_deferred = waiting\n            note('Binding page code not resident yet (' .. waiting .. '); the MODS tab waits.')\n        end\n        return\n    end\n    state.release_pending = true\n"
